gnome-shell-extension-xdock (2.3.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Keep magnification smooth and running-app lights centered across the dock.
  * Pace magnification with the display and reduce repeated layout work.
  * Reduce idle launcher memory and unnecessary window-overlap tracking.
  * Support GNOME Shell 51 and its reduced-motion preference.
  * Expand native motion, input and clean-shutdown regression coverage.

 -- Norvi <apt@globalentry.systems>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:40:00 +0000

